/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 64 0 R
/E (The traffic simulation models a network of three interconnected intersections, each with a traffic light, incoming and outgoing roads, and a vehicle queue. Vehicles arrive according to a Poisson distribution with rush-hour effects between time steps 30 and 70.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
